This is the shared documentation for the '''main page fragments''' — the building blocks of [[Utaite Wiki]] and [[Youtaite Wiki]]. They are '''not general-purpose templates'''. Each one renders a single section of one specific page, so they are split out only to keep the main pages editable in small pieces.

To change what appears on a main page, edit the '''fragment''', not the main page itself.

== Page composition ==
The two main pages share most fragments and swap in <code>Y-</code> prefixed variants for the Youtaite-specific parts.

=== [[Utaite Wiki]] (primary main page) ===
<pre>
{{MP-Welcome}}              ← greeting line
{{MP-Banner}}               ← hero banner + wiki statistics
{{SiteAnnouncement}}        ← site notice          (shared)
{{MP-Editing}}              ← "Before You Edit!" notice
{{ProcessBirthdayCategory}} ← today's birthdays    (shared)
{{MP-Admins}}               ← staff table          (shared)
{{Announcement}}            ← wiki news feed       (shared)
{{MP-Blog|height=400px}}    ← recent blogs         (shared)
{{MP-Right}}                ← right column, contains {{WeeklyTop3}} + {{DiscordIntegrator}}
{{NNDfooter}}               ← related wikis        (shared)
</pre>

=== [[Youtaite Wiki]] (secondary main page) ===
<pre>
{{Y-MP-Welcome}}            ← greeting line, red theme
{{Y-MP-Banner}}             ← hero banner, red theme
{{SiteAnnouncement}}        ← site notice          (shared)
{{Y-MP-Editing}}            ← "Before You Edit!", contains {{MP-Statistic}}
{{ProcessBirthdayCategory|cat=Youtaite}}           (shared, filtered)
{{MP-Admins}}               ← staff table          (shared)
{{Announcement}}            ← wiki news feed       (shared)
{{MP-Blog}}                 ← recent blogs         (shared)
{{Y-MP-Right}}              ← right column, contains {{DiscordIntegrator}}
{{NNDfooter}}               ← related wikis        (shared)
{{MP-Bottom}}               ← background image credit
</pre>

Two container variants also assemble these fragments: {{T|MP-Mobile}} (mobile layout) and {{T|Y-MP-Left}} (Youtaite left column).

