== Parameters ==
Most fragments take no parameters. The exceptions:
{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Template !! Parameter !! Description !! Default
|-
| {{T|MP-Blog}} || <code>height</code> || CSS height of the scroll box. || 230px
|-
| {{T|DiscordIntegrator}} || <code>1</code> / <code>id</code> || Discord server ID. || –
|-
| {{T|DiscordIntegrator}} || <code>theme</code> || Widget theme, e.g. <code>dark</code>. || –
|-
| {{T|DiscordIntegrator}} || <code>width</code> || Widget width. || 100%
|-
| {{T|DiscordIntegrator}} || <code>height</code> || Widget height. || 90%
|}

